# Normalize line endings to LF for all text files, both in the repository and on
# checkout. This matches the project's Prettier (`endOfLine: lf`) and EditorConfig
# (`end_of_line = lf`) conventions and overrides a contributor's `core.autocrlf`
# setting, so the working tree no longer shows phantom CRLF/LF modifications on
# Windows. Binary assets (png, ico, woff2, wasm, ...) are auto-detected and left untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
